SEISMIC FRACTAL ANALYSIS - BAYESIAN HIERARCHICAL FRAMEWORK
Version 4.0.0

Contact:
- Facundo Firmenich: f.firmenich@cedesur.org
- ORCID: 0009-0002-6578-3811
- Affiliation: Universitat de Barcelona / Centro de Estudios del Sur {CEDESUR}

This software includes:
- Grassberger-Procaccia correlation dimension estimator
- Box-counting multifractal spectrum analyzer
- Mad Heuristic black swan tail-focus explorer
- Ramanujan nestings recursive analyzer
- Bayesian threshold selection
- Sparse k-NN Moran's I spatial autocorrelation
- Clark-Evans 3D clustering index
- USGS FDSN API integration with pagination

Dependencies (see requirements.txt for versions):
- NumPy, SciPy, Pandas (BSD-3-Clause)
- Matplotlib (PSF-like)
- Requests (Apache-2.0)

All dependencies are compatible with GPLv3.
